674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gjrNJKvSNj4Q7kNvwHT2FQE&_nc_oc=AdpFiD_SclxVxjviFCh94gAdqsqsT5n2FR35KJYQ9I2W0p-2ulRn8zvEyRGvyb8BV1c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3f8toH8u3Q8mNS3Wjo4Ex2sKL3hr5JjXQGb1DuQSMzvA&oe=69EB7ED9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JU9zNzcZj1UQ7kNvwF7P6ho&_nc_oc=AdrrE1jhK0kspZfnUsbtiWK2xbpHF5YEz-fT1M3nT7A24XS0eIM3Tl84P6EVkWF5uKk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0srX7bn8Hb1RBJOqsVoRq8win3vthYQUIQhLUDQ1coqw&oe=69EB8796"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=63fjF6IinFoQ7kNvwGr0XVu&_nc_oc=AdrscC3DmzmaQRh-fr_62mefsAdgbKxhUSVYdKEcxQ3F0IdYzEsQwnobhtjKGscCaLU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0v0JRhe_c3EXVp1L3r_Kax0Z66w5oHyv-v7Z4aIbyO5g&oe=69EB83B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip